      "description": "The top text 'black people' is mapped onto the visual entity 'holding_funnel' (the woman holding the rusty funnel). The rusty, worn-out funnel is used as a metaphor to represent Black people as 'anthing that doesn't belong to them' (bottom text), creating a racist analogical mapping that dehumanizes the group by equating them with an object of exclusion and dispossession.",
